 helps us ensure that ISET programming is reaching its intended audience. The program is open to Indigenous women in their diversity.\", \"fr\": \"Cette question nous aide à garantir que la programmation ISET atteint son public cible. Le programme est ouvert aux femmes autochtones dans toute leur diversité.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"biological-sex\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Select the sex you were assigned at birth as recorded on your birth certificate.\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez le sexe qui vous a été attribué à la naissance tel qu\'inscrit sur votre certificat de naissance.\"}, \"name\": \"biological_sex\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios--inline\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What is your biological sex?\", \"fr\": \"Quel est votre sexe biologique ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Female\", \"fr\": \"Femme\"}, \"value\": \"female\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Male\", \"fr\": \"Homme\"}, \"value\": \"male\"}], \"required\": true, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"biological_sex\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"errorMessage\": {\"en\": \"Select an option for what is your gender identity?\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez une option pour what is your gender identity?\"}, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Select the sex you were assigned at birth as recorded on your birth certificate.\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez le sexe qui vous a été attribué à la naissance tel qu’indiqué sur votre certificat de naissance.\"}}, \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\"}, {\"id\": \"gender-identity\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Select the gender you identify with. This may be the same as or different from your biological sex.\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez le genre auquel vous vous identifiez. Cela peut être le même que votre sexe biologique ou différent.\"}, \"name\": \"gender_identity\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios--inline\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What is you gender identity?\", \"fr\": \"Quelle est votre identité de genre ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Female\", \"fr\": \"Femme\"}, \"value\": \"female\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Male\", \"fr\": \"Homme\"}, \"value\": \"male\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Other\", \"fr\": \"Autre\"}, \"value\": \"other\"}], \"required\": true, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"gender_identity\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Select the gender you identify with. This may be the same as or different from your biological sex.\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez le genre auquel vous vous identifiez. Il peut être identique ou différent de votre sexe biologique.\"}}, \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"contact-information\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Contact Information\", \"fr\": \"Contact Information\"}, \"stepId\": \"contact-information\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Contact Information\", \"fr\": \"Coordonnées\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Provide your contact details so we can reach you during the application process.\", \"fr\": \"Fournissez vos coordonnées afin que nous puissions vous joindre pendant le processus de demande.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body-l\"}, {\"id\": \"address-street-address\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Include apartment or unit number if applicable\", \"fr\": \"Incluez le numéro d\'appartement ou d\'unité, si applicable\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Street Address\", \"fr\": \"Adresse\"}, \"required\": true, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"storageKey\": \"address-street-address\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true}, \"autocomplete\": \"street-address\"}, {\"id\": \"address-city\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"City\", \"fr\": \"Ville\"}, \"required\": true, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"storageKey\": \"address-city\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true}, \"autocomplete\": \"address-level2\"}, {\"id\": \"address-province\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Select which provice or territory you live in.\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez la province ou le territoire où vous résidez.\"}, \"type\": \"select\", \"class\": \"govuk-select\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Province or Territory\", \"fr\": \"Province ou territoire\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Alberta\", \"fr\": \"Alberta\"}, \"value\": \"ab\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"British Columbia\", \"fr\": \"Colombie-Britannique\"}, \"value\": \"bc\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Manitoba\", \"fr\": \"Manitoba\"}, \"value\": \"mb\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"New Brunswick\", \"fr\": \"Nouveau-Brunswick\"}, \"value\": \"nb\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Newfoundland and Labrador\", \"fr\": \"Terre-Neuve-et-Labrador\"}, \"value\": \"nl\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Northwest Territories\", \"fr\": \"Territoires du Nord-Ouest\"}, \"value\": \"nt\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Nova Scotia\", \"fr\": \"Nouvelle-Écosse\"}, \"value\": \"ns\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Nunavut\", \"fr\": \"Nunavut\"}, \"value\": \"nu\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Ontario\", \"fr\": \"Ontario\"}, \"value\": \"on\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Prince Edward Island\", \"fr\": \"Île-du-Prince-Édouard\"}, \"value\": \"pe\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Quebec\", \"fr\": \"Québec\"}, \"value\": \"qc\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Saskatchewan\", \"fr\": \"Saskatchewan\"}, \"value\": \"sk\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Yukon\", \"fr\": \"Yukon\"}, \"value\": \"yt\"}], \"required\": true, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"storageKey\": \"address-province\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true}}, {\"id\": \"address-postcode\", \"mask\": \"postal-code-ca\", \"type\": \"input\", \"cl