Emergency Contact Phone Number\", \"fr\": \"Numéro de téléphone de la personne à contacter en cas d\'urgence\"}, \"required\": true, \"inputMode\": \"tel\", \"inputType\": \"tel\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"storageKey\": \"emergency-contact-telephone\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"errorMessage\": {\"en\": \"Enter emergency contact phone number\", \"fr\": \"Entrez emergency contact phone number\"}, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Enter emergency contact phone number\", \"fr\": \"Entrez emergency contact phone number\"}}}, {\"id\": \"emergency-contact-relationship\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"For example: Parent, Friend, Caseworker, Partner\", \"fr\": \"Par exemple : Parent, Ami, Travailleur social, Partenaire\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Relationship to You\", \"fr\": \"Lien avec vous\"}, \"required\": true, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"emergency-contact-relationship\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"errorMessage\": {\"en\": \"Enter relationship to you\", \"fr\": \"Entrez relationship to you\"}, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Enter relationship to you\", \"fr\": \"Entrez relationship to you\"}}}], \"nextStepId\": \"indigenous-legal-identity\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Indigenous Legal Identity\", \"fr\": \"Indigenous Legal Identity\"}, \"stepId\": \"indigenous-legal-identity\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"legal-indigenous-identity\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Please select the category that best describes your legal recognition in Canada.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez sélectionner la catégorie qui décrit le mieux votre reconnaissance légale au Canada.\"}, \"name\": \"legal-indigenous-identity\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Legal Indigenous Identity\", \"fr\": \"Identité autochtone légale\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"First Nations (Status)\", \"fr\": \"Premières Nations (avec statut)\"}, \"value\": \"first_nations_status\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"First Nations (Non-Status)\", \"fr\": \"Premières Nations (sans statut)\"}, \"value\": \"first_nations_non_status\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Inuit\", \"fr\": \"Inuit\"}, \"value\": \"inuit\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Métis\", \"fr\": \"Métis\"}, \"value\": \"metis\"}], \"required\": true, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"legal-indigenous-identity\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"errorMessage\": {\"en\": \"Select an option for legal indigenous identity\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez une option pour legal indigenous identity\"}, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Select an option for legal indigenous identity\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez une option pour legal indigenous identity\"}}, \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"registration-number\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Registration Number\", \"fr\": \"Registration Number\"}, \"stepId\": \"registration-number\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"has-reg-number\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Status card, Métis citizenship, or Inuit enrolment/beneficiary number.\", \"fr\": \"Carte de statut, citoyenneté métisse ou numéro d\'inscription/bénéficiaire inuit.\"}, \"name\": \"has_reg_number\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios--inline\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Do you have an Indigenous ID number?\", \"fr\": \"Avez-vous un numéro d\'identification autochtone ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"required\": true, \"normalize\": \"yn-01\", \"storageKey\": \"has_reg_number\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please select an option\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez sélectionner une 