ployed-on-approved-leave\"}, {\"label\": \"Self-employed\", \"value\": \"self-employed\"}, {\"label\": \"Student\", \"value\": \"student\"}, {\"label\": \"Other\", \"value\": \"other\"}], \"required\": true, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"labour-force-status\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true}, \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}, {\"id\": \"highest-education\", \"name\": \"highest-education\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios--small\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What highest level of education did you complete?\", \"fr\": \"Quel est le niveau d’éducation le plus élevé que vous avez atteint ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"No formal education\", \"fr\": \"Aucune éducation formelle\"}, \"value\": \"no_formal_education\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Up to Grade 7–8 (Secondaire I–II)\", \"fr\": \"Jusqu’à la 7e–8e année (Secondaire I–II)\"}, \"value\": \"grade_7_8\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Grade 9–10 (Secondaire III)\", \"fr\": \"9e–10e année (Secondaire III)\"}, \"value\": \"grade_9_10\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Grade 11–12 (Secondaire IV–V)\", \"fr\": \"11e–12e année (Secondaire IV–V)\"}, \"value\": \"grade_11_12\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Secondary School Diploma or GED\", \"fr\": \"Diplôme d’études secondaires ou GED\"}, \"value\": \"secondary_school_diploma_or_ged\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Some post-secondary training\", \"fr\": \"Certaines formations postsecondaires\"}, \"value\": \"post_secondary_training\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Apprenticeship/trades certificate or diploma\", \"fr\": \"Certificat ou diplôme d\'apprentissage/métiers\"}, \"value\": \"apprenticeship_trades\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"CEGEP or other non-university certificate/diploma\", \"fr\": \"DEC ou autre certificat/diplôme non universitaire\"}, \"value\": \"cegep\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"College or other non-university certificate/diploma\", \"fr\": \"Certificat ou diplôme collégial ou autre certificat/diplôme non universitaire\"}, \"value\": \"co