tif de formation et d\'emploi en lien avec le financement/le soutien de l\'ISET\"}, \"rows\": 5, \"type\": \"character-count\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What is your long-term goal?\", \"fr\": \"Quel est votre objectif à long terme ?\"}, \"required\": false, \"maxLength\": 500, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"threshold\": 75, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"long-term-goal\"}, {\"id\": \"barriers\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Select all that apply.\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez toutes les options applicables.\"}, \"name\": \"barriers\", \"type\": \"checkboxes\", \"class\": \"govuk-checkboxes\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What barriers are you currently facing?\", \"fr\": \"Quels obstacles rencontrez-vous actuellement ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Education\", \"fr\": \"Éducation\"}, \"value\": \"education\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Funding\", \"fr\": \"Financement\"}, \"value\": \"funding\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Lack of Job Opportunities\", \"fr\": \"Manque d\'opportunités d\'emploi\"}, \"value\": \"lack-of-job-opportunities\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Location\", \"fr\": \"Emplacement\"}, \"value\": \"location\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Other\", \"fr\": \"Autre\"}, \"value\": \"other\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"other-barrier\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Enter the requested value.\", \"fr\": \"Entrez la valeur demandée.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other barrier (please specify)\", \"fr\": \"Autre obstacle (veuillez préciser)\"}, \"required\": false, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"other-barrier\"}]}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"barriers\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}, {\"id\": \"target-program\", \"name\": \"target-program\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Have you already identified a training program or employer?\", \"fr\": \"Avez-vous déjà identifié un programme de formation ou un employeur ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Formal training such as college, university, or vocational courses that help you gain new skills or credentials.\", \"fr\": \"Formation formelle telle que collège, université ou cours professionnels qui vous aident à acquérir de nouvelles compétences ou qualifications.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Skills Development (Education)\", \"fr\": \"Développement des compétences (Éducation)\"}, \"value\": \"skills_development\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Support to help an employer hire you by covering part of your wages during a training or probation period.\", \"fr\": \"Soutien pour aider un employeur à vous embaucher en couvrant une partie de votre salaire durant une période de formation ou de probation.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Targeted Wage Subsidy\", \"fr\": \"Subvention salariale ciblée\"}, \"value\": \"tws\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Short-term work experience on a community or project-based initiative that builds your employability.\", \"fr\": \"Expérience de travail à court terme dans une initiative communautaire ou basée sur un projet qui développe votre employabilité.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Job Creation Partnership\", \"fr\": \"Partenariat de création d\'emploi\"}, \"value\": \"jcp\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Training delivered to a group of participants with similar learning goals, often led by an employer or community partner.\", \"fr\": \"Formation offerte à un groupe de participants ayant des objectifs d\'apprentissage similaires, souvent dirigée par un employeur ou un partenaire communautaire.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Group Training\", \"fr\": \"Formation en groupe\"}, \"value\": \"group\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Assistance to start or grow your own business, including business planning or mentorship.\", \"fr\": \"Assistance pour démarrer ou développer votre propre entreprise, incluant la planification d\'affaires ou le mentorat.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Self-employment Supports\", \"fr\": \"Soutien à l\'auto-entrepreneuriat\"}, \"value\": \"self_support\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"You have not yet chosen a specific program or employer.\", \"fr\": \"Vous n\'avez pas encore choisi de programme ou d\'employeur spécifique.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Not yet\", \"fr\": \"Pas encore\"}, \"value\": \"not_yet\"}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"target-program\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"financial-supports-requested\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Financial Supports Requested\", \"fr\": \"Financial Supports Requested\"}, \"stepId\": \"financial-supports-requested\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Financial Supports Requested\", \"fr\": \"Prêts financiers demandés\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Tell us what financial support you are requesting to help you reach your employment goal.\", \"fr\": \"Dites-nous quels prêts financiers vous demandez pour vous aider à atteindre votre objectif d\'emploi.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body-l\"}, {\"id\": \"requested-supports\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Select all that apply.\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez toutes les options applicables.\"}, \"name\": \"requested-supports\", \"type\": \"checkboxes\", \"class\": \"govuk-checkboxes\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Which of the following supports are you requesting?\", \"fr\": \"Quels sont les soutiens suivants que vous demandez ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Costs for course or program tuition and mandatory fees\", \"fr\": \"Coûts liés aux frais de scolarité du cours ou du programme et aux frais obligatoires\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Tuition\", \"fr\": \"Frais de scolarité\"}, \"value\": \"tuition\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Costs for textbooks, supplies, and other required learning materials\", \"fr\": \"Coûts pour les manuels, les fournitures et autres matériels d’apprentissage obligatoires\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Books or Program Materials\", \"fr\": \"Livres ou matériel de programme\"}, \"value\": \"books\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Costs for housing, groceries and basic utilities\", \"fr\": \"Coûts pour le logement, les courses et les services publics de base\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Living Allowance\", \"fr\": \"Allocation de vie\"}, \"value\": \"living\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Costs for commuting, transit passes, fuel, or other travel related to the program\", \"fr\": \"Coûts liés aux déplacements domicile‑études, aux laissez‑passer de transport en commun, au carburant ou à tout autre déplacement lié au programme\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Transportation\", \"fr\": \"Transport\"}, \"value\": \"transportation\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Costs for daycare, babysitting, or other dependent care while attending the program\", \"fr\": \"Coûts pour la garderie, le babysitting ou d’autres services de garde de personnes à charge pendant que vous suivez le programme\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Childcare\", \"fr\": \"Garde d’enfants\"}, \"value\": \"childcare\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"childcare-fuding-status\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"What best describes your current childcare support status.  Check all that apply.\", \"fr\": \"Quelle option décrit le mieux votre situation actuelle en matière de soutien à la garde d’enfants? Cochez toutes les réponses qui s’appliquent.\"}, \"name\": \"childcare-fuding-status\", \"type\": \"checkboxes\", \"class\": \"govuk-checkboxes\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Current childcare support status\", \"fr\": \"Situation actuelle en matière de soutien à la garde d’enfants\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"No funding received\", \"fr\": \"Aucun financement reçu\"}, \"value\": \"no-funding-received\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"EI/CRF\", \"fr\": \"AE/CRF\"}, \"value\": \"ei-crf\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Provincial funding/subsidy\", \"fr\": \"Financement/subvention provincial(e)\"}, \"value\": \"provincial-funding-subsidy\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"FNICCI\", \"fr\": \"FNICCI\"}, \"value\": \"fnicci\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Daycare not available\", \"fr\": \"Aucune garderie disponible\"}, \"value\": \"daycare-not-available\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Assisted by family\", \"fr\": \"Aide fournie par la famille\"}, \"value\": \"assisted-by-family\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Self-funded\", \"fr\": \"Autofinancement\"}, \"value\": \"self-funded\"}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"childcare-fuding-status\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\"}]}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Any other eligible education-related costs not listed above\", \"fr\": \"Tout autre coût admissible lié aux études qui n’est pas mentionné ci‑dessus\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other\", \"fr\": \"Autre\"}, \"value\": \"other\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"other-requested-support\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other support (please specify)\", \"fr\": \"Autre soutien (veuillez préciser)\"}, \"required\": false, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"other-requested-support\"}]}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"requested-supports\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}, {\"id\": \"disability-support\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Are you requesting specific funding to support your disability while attending a training/educational institution (such as an e-reader). You will need to identify what support you are requesting and will have to provide medical documentation indicating you have a disability and require the requested support.\", \"fr\": \"Demandez-vous un financement spécifique pour soutenir votre handicap pendant que vous suivez une formation ou fréquentez un établissement d\'enseignement (comme un lecteur électronique) ? Vous devrez préciser le soutien que vous demandez et fournir une documentation médicale indiquant que vous avez un handicap et que vous avez besoin du soutien demandé.\"}, \"name\": \"disability-support\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Are you requesting support in relation to your disability?\", \"fr\": \"Demandez-vous un soutien en lien avec votre handicap ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"disability-support-yes-follow\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Please tell us what support you are requesting in relation to your disability.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez nous indiquer le soutien que vous demandez en lien avec votre handicap.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Requested support\", \"fr\": \"Soutien demandé\"}, \"required\": false, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"disability-support_yes_follow\"}]}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"yn-01\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"has-disability\", \"value\": \"1\"}]}, \"storageKey\": \"disability-support\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"student-loans-and-grants\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Student Loans and Grants\", \"fr\": \"Student Loans and Grants\"}, \"stepId\": \"student-loans-and-grants\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"loan-grant\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Include any current student loans or education-related grants.\", \"fr\": \"Incluez tous les prêts ou bourses d\'études que vous recevez actuellement.\"}, \"name\": \"loan-grant\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Do you receive any student loans or grants?\", \"fr\": \"Recevez-vous des prêts ou des bourses d\'études?\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"loan-grant-details\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Provide the name of the loan or grant and the amount you receive.\", \"fr\": \"Indiquez le nom du prêt ou de la bourse et le montant que vous recevez.\"}, \"rows\": 5, \"type\": \"character-count\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Student Loan/Grant Details\", \"fr\": \"Détails sur le prêt ou la bourse d\'études\"}, \"required\": false, \"maxLength\": 200, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"threshold\": 75, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"loan-grant-details\"}]}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"required\": true, \"normalize\": \"yn-01\", \"storageKey\": \"loan-grant\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"This field is required.\", \"fr\": \"Ce champ est obligatoire.\"}}, \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"household-income\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Household Income\", \"fr\": \"Household Income\"}, \"stepId\": \"household-income\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Household Income\", \"fr\": \"Revenu du ménage\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Please disclose all sources of monthly household income. Documentation and proof of financial situation is required prior to any approval of funding.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez divulguer toutes les sources de revenu mensuel du ménage. Une documentation et une preuve de la situation financière sont requises avant toute approbation de financement.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body-l\"}, {\"id\": \"income-employment\", \"mask\": \"currency\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Employment Income\", \"fr\": \"Revenu d\'emploi\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"notEquals\", \"ref\": \"labour-force-status\", \"value\": \"unemployed\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"storageKey\": \"income-employment\"}, {\"id\": \"income-spousal\", \"mask\": \"currency\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Spousal Income\", \"fr\": \"Revenu du conjoint\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"marital-status\", \"value\": \"married\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"income-spousal\"}, {\"id\": \"income-social-assist\", \"mask\": \"currency\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Social Assistance\", \"fr\": \"Aide sociale\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"social-assistance\", \"value\": \"1\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"income-social-assist\"}, {\"id\": \"income-child-support\", \"mask\": \"currency\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Child Support\", \"fr\": \"Pension alimentaire pour enfants\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"dependent-children\", \"value\": \"1\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"income-child-support\"}, {\"id\": \"income-child-benefit\", \"mask\": \"currency\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Child Tax Benefit\", \"fr\": \"Prestation fiscale pour enfants\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"exists\", \"ref\": \"dependent-children\"}, {\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"dependent-children\", \"value\": \"1\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"income-child-benefit\"}, {\"id\": \"income-jordans\", \"mask\": \"currency\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Jordan’s Principle\", \"fr\": \"Principe de Jordan\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"income-jordans\"}, {\"id\": \"income-band-funding\", \"mask\": \"currency\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Band or Nation Funding\", \"fr\": \"Financement de bande ou de nation\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"income-band-funding\"}, {\"id\": \"income-alimony\", \"mask\": \"currency\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Alimony/Spousal Support\", \"fr\": \"Pension alimentaire/Prestation conjointe\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"marital-status\", \"value\": \"divorced\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"income-alimony\"}, {\"id\": \"income-other\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Please specify the source(s) of income\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez préciser la ou les sources de revenus\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other Income (if applicable)\", \"fr\": \"Autres revenus (le cas échéant)\"}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"text\", \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"income-other\"}, {\"id\": \"income-other-description\", \"mask\": \"currency\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other Income\", \"fr\": \"Autres revenus\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"storageKey\": \"income-other-description\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"household-expenses\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Household Expenses\", \"fr\": \"Household Expenses\"}, \"stepId\": \"household-expenses\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Household Expenses\", \"fr\": \"Dépenses ménagères\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Please disclose all sources of monthly household income. Documentation and proof of financial situation is required prior to any approval of funding.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez divulguer toutes les sources de revenus mensuels du foyer. La documentation et la preuve de la situation financière sont requises avant toute approbation de financement.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body-l\"}, {\"id\": \"expenses-rent\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Your share of monthly rent or mortgage payments for your primary residence, including mandatory housing fees. Do not include home repairs, property taxes, or insurance.\", \"fr\": \"Votre part du loyer mensuel ou des paiements hypothécaires pour votre résidence principale, y compris les frais de logement obligatoires. N’incluez pas les réparations domiciliaires, les taxes foncières ou l’assurance.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Rent/Mortgage\", \"fr\": \"Loyer/Hypothèque\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"storageKey\": \"expenses-rent\"}, {\"id\": \"expenses-groceries\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Include basic food items, fresh produce, bread, dairy, meat, pantry staples, and essential household supplies— not including takeout, restaurants, or alcohol.\", \"fr\": \"Incluez les aliments de base, les produits frais, le pain, les produits laitiers, la viande, les aliments de garde-manger et les fournitures ménagères essentielles—sans inclure la restauration à emporter, les restaurants ou l’alcool.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Groceries\", \"fr\": \"Épicerie\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\"