nd-claims card.\", \"fr\": \"Entrez votre numéro de bénéficiaire ou d\'inscription exactement comme il apparaît sur votre carte de revendications territoriales.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What is your registration number?\", \"fr\": \"Quel est votre numéro d\'inscription ?\"}, \"required\": false, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"legal-indigenous-identity\", \"value\": \"inuit\"}, {\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"has_reg_number\", \"value\": \"yes\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--l\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"inuit-registration-number\", \"autocomplete\": \"registration-number\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"home-community\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Home Community\", \"fr\": \"Home Community\"}, \"stepId\": \"home-community\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"home-comminuty\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Your First Nation, Métis, or Inuit community.\", \"fr\": \"Votre communauté des Premières Nations, métisse ou inuit.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What is your home community?\", \"fr\": \"Quelle est votre communauté d’origine?\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"{indigenous-affiliation-declaration}\"}, \"required\": false, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--l\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"home-comminuty\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"demographics\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Demographics\", \"fr\": \"Demographics\"}, \"stepId\": \"demographics\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Demographics\", \"fr\": \"Démographie\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"This information helps us understand your circumstances and ensure equitable a