r.\", \"fr\": \"Formation offerte à un groupe de participants ayant des objectifs d\'apprentissage similaires, souvent dirigée par un employeur ou un partenaire communautaire.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Group Training\", \"fr\": \"Formation en groupe\"}, \"value\": \"group\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Assistance to start or grow your own business, including business planning or mentorship.\", \"fr\": \"Assistance pour démarrer ou développer votre propre entreprise, incluant la planification d\'affaires ou le mentorat.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Self-employment Supports\", \"fr\": \"Soutien à l\'auto-entrepreneuriat\"}, \"value\": \"self_support\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"You have not yet chosen a specific program or employer.\", \"fr\": \"Vous n\'avez pas encore choisi de programme ou d\'employeur spécifique.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Not yet\", \"fr\": \"Pas encore\"}, \"value\": \"not_yet\"}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"target-program\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"financial-supports-requested\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Financial Supports Requested\", \"fr\": \"Financial Supports Requested\"}, \"stepId\": \"financial-supports-requested\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Financial Supports Requested\", \"fr\": \"Prêts financiers demandés\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Tell us what financial support you are requesting to help you reach your employment goal.\", \"fr\": \"Dites-nous quels prêts financiers vous demandez pour vous aider à atteindre votre objectif d\'emploi.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body-l\"}, {\"id\": \"requested-supports\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Select all that apply.\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez toutes les options applicables.\"}, \"name\": \"requested-supports\", \"type\": \"checkboxes\",