fants? Cochez toutes les réponses qui s’appliquent.\"}, \"name\": \"childcare-fuding-status\", \"type\": \"checkboxes\", \"class\": \"govuk-checkboxes\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Current childcare support status\", \"fr\": \"Situation actuelle en matière de soutien à la garde d’enfants\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"No funding received\", \"fr\": \"Aucun financement reçu\"}, \"value\": \"no-funding-received\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"EI/CRF\", \"fr\": \"AE/CRF\"}, \"value\": \"ei-crf\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Provincial funding/subsidy\", \"fr\": \"Financement/subvention provincial(e)\"}, \"value\": \"provincial-funding-subsidy\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"FNICCI\", \"fr\": \"FNICCI\"}, \"value\": \"fnicci\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Daycare not available\", \"fr\": \"Aucune garderie disponible\"}, \"value\": \"daycare-not-available\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Assisted by family\", \"fr\": \"Aide fournie par la famille\"}, \"value\": \"assisted-by-family\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Self-funded\", \"fr\": \"Autofinancement\"}, \"value\": \"self-funded\"}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"childcare-fuding-status\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\"}]}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Any other eligible education-related costs not listed above\", \"fr\": \"Tout autre coût admissible lié aux études qui n’est pas mentionné ci‑dessus\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other\", \"fr\": \"Autre\"}, \"value\": \"other\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"other-requested-support\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other support (please specify)\", \"fr\": \"Autre soutien (veuillez préciser)\"}, \"required\": false, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"other-requested-support\"}]}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"requested-supports\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}, {\"id\": \"disability-support\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Are you requesting specific funding to support your disability while attending a training/educational institution (such as an e-reader). You will need to identify what support you are requesting and will have to provide medical documentation indicating you have a disability and require the requested support.\", \"fr\": \"Demandez-vous un financement spécifique pour soutenir votre handicap pendant que vous suivez une formation ou fréquentez un établissement d\'enseignement (comme un lecteur électronique) ? Vous devrez préciser le soutien que vous demandez et fournir une documentation médicale indiquant que vous avez un handicap et que vous avez besoin du soutien demandé.\"}, \"name\": \"disability-support\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Are you requesting support in relation to your disability?\", \"fr\": \"Demandez-vous un soutien en lien avec votre handicap ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"disability-support-yes-follow\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Please tell us what support you are requesting in relation to your disability.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez nous indiquer le soutien que vous demandez en lien avec votre handicap.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Requested support\", \"fr\": \"Soutien demandé\"}, \"required\": false, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"disability-support_yes_follow\"}]}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"yn-01\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"has-disability\", \"value\": \"1\"}]}, \"storageKey\": \"disability-support\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"student-loans-and-grants\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {