 basic food items, fresh produce, bread, dairy, meat, pantry staples, and essential household supplies— not including takeout, restaurants, or alcohol.\", \"fr\": \"Incluez les aliments de base, les produits frais, le pain, les produits laitiers, la viande, les aliments de garde-manger et les fournitures ménagères essentielles—sans inclure la restauration à emporter, les restaurants ou l’alcool.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Groceries\", \"fr\": \"Épicerie\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"expenses-groceries\"}, {\"id\": \"expenses-electricity\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Monthly electricity bill from a public utility or prepaid electricity.\", \"fr\": \"Facture mensuelle d’électricité d’une entreprise de services publics ou électricité prépayée.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Electricity/Hydro\", \"fr\": \"Électricité/Hydro\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"expenses-electricity\"}, {\"id\": \"expenses-heating\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Natural gas, Heating oil / kerosene Propane Wood, pellets, or other purchased solid fuels, Diesel or gasoline for a generator only where it is the primary heat/power source, District heating if applicable\", \"fr\": \"Gaz naturel, mazout/chérosène, propane, bois, granulés ou autres combustibles solides achetés, diesel ou essence pour un générateur uniquement lorsqu’il est la source principale de chauffage/énergie, chauffage de quartier si applicable\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Home Heating\", \"fr\": \"Chauffage domestique\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"storageKey\": \"expenses-heating\"}, {\"id\": \"expenses-water\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"E.g. municipal water charges, rural water delivery / trucked wter, or community co-op or band-managed water fees charged to households.\", \"fr\": \"Par ex. frais municipaux d’eau, livraison d’eau rurale / eau livrée par camion, ou frais d’eau gérés par une coopérative communautaire ou une bande facturés aux ménages.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Water\", \"fr\": \"Eau\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"expenses-water\"}, {\"id\": \"expenses-sewerage\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Municipal sewer fees, charge-per-use wastewater utilities, septic system services directly tied to occupancy, e.g. regular pump-outs if required to safely inhabit the dwelling (NOT major repairs or replacement)\", \"fr\": \"Frais municipaux d’égouts, frais à l’usage pour les services d’eaux usées, services de système septique liés directement à l’occupation, par ex. vidanges régulières si nécessaires pour habiter le logement en toute sécurité (PAS les réparations majeures ou le remplacement)\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Sewer / Wastewater\", \"fr\": \"Égout / eaux usées\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": \"$\"}, \