\", \"fr\": \"Stationnement (à l\'école)\"}, \"value\": \"parking\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"expenses-parking\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Price of parking at the school\", \"fr\": \"Prix du stationnement à l\'école\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Parking Charges\", \"fr\": \"Frais de stationnement\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"expenses-parking\"}]}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Mileage (home to school)\", \"fr\": \"Kilométrage (domicile-école)\"}, \"value\": \"mileage\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"expenses-transport-mileage\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"To and from home and school each month\", \"fr\": \"Vers et depuis la maison et l\'école chaque mois\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Mileage\", \"fr\": \"Kilométrage\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"km per month\", \"fr\": \"km par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"expenses_transport_mileage\"}]}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"expenses-transport\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\"}, {\"id\": \"expenses-other-list\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"List only expenses directly related to your training or education program. Personal or household expenses (such as car payments, credit card bills, or pet care) are not eligible.\", \"fr\": \"Indiquez uniquement les dépenses directement liées à votre programme de formation ou d’éducation. Les dépenses personnelles ou ménagères (comme les paiements de voiture, les factures de carte d