enefit\", \"fr\": \"Prestation fiscale pour enfants\"}}, {\"key\": \"income-jordans\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Jordan’s Principle\", \"fr\": \"Principe de Jordan\"}}, {\"key\": \"income-band-funding\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Band Funding\", \"fr\": \"Financement de la bande\"}}, {\"key\": \"income-alimony\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Alimony/Spousal Support\", \"fr\": \"Pension alimentaire/Prestation conjointe\"}}, {\"key\": \"income-other\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other Income (if applicable)\", \"fr\": \"Autres revenus (le cas échéant)\"}}, {\"key\": \"income-other-description\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other Income\", \"fr\": \"Autres revenus\"}}], \"type\": \"summary-list\", \"hideEmpty\": true, \"emptyFallback\": {\"en\": \"Not provided\", \"fr\": \"Non fourni\"}}, {\"id\": \"summary-list-10\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"expenses-rent\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Rent/Mortgage\", \"fr\": \"Loyer/Hypothèque\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses-groceries\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Groceries\", \"fr\": \"Épicerie\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses-utilities\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Utilities (Hydro, water, natural gas, sewer, garbage)\", \"fr\": \"Services publics (Hydro, eau, gaz naturel, égout, poubelle)\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses_transport\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Transport Expenses\", \"fr\": \"Frais de transport\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses_bus_pass\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Bus Pass\", \"fr\": \"Passe d\'autobus\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses-parking\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Parking Charges\", \"fr\": \"Frais de stationnement\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses_transport_mileage\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Mileage\", \"fr\": \"Mileage\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses-other-list\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Additional Training-Related Expenses\", \"fr\": \"Dépenses supplémentaires liées à la formation\"}}, {\"key\": \"telephone-alt\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other Expenses\", \"fr\": \"Autres dépenses\"}, \"originalKey\": \"example-input-5\"}], \"type\": \"summary-list\", \"hideEmpty\": true, \"emptyFallback\": {\"en\": \"Not provided\", \"fr\": \"Non fourni\"}}], \"nextStepId\": \"iset-document-upload\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"ISET Document Upload\", \"fr\": \"ISET Document Upload\"}, \"stepId\": \"iset-document-upload\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Document Upload\", \"fr\": \"Téléversement de documents\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Based on your answers the following documents must be submitted in support of your application. You can upload scans or use the camera on your phone if you are using one.\", \"fr\": \"En fonction de vos réponses, les documents suivants doivent être soumis pour appuyer votre demande. Vous pouvez télécharger des scans ou utiliser la caméra de votre téléphone si vous en utilisez un.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body-l\"}, {\"id\": \"govt-id\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Upload a clear image of a government-issued photo ID (driver’s licence, provincial/territorial ID card, or passport). If the card has information on both sides, capture front and back as separate images so your name, photo, and expiry date are fully legible.\", \"fr\": \"Toujours requis comme document d\'identité secondaire\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Government-Issued ID\", \"fr\": \"Pièce d\'identité délivrée par le gouvernement\"}, \"accept\": \"image/*\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 10, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"govt-id\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload the front and back of your ID\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser le recto et le verso de votre pièce d’identité\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"identity_document\", \"showMimeList\": true, \"documentLabel\": \"Government ID\"}, {\"id\": \"status-card\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Upload a clear image of both sides of your Status/Treaty card (or equivalent proof of Indigenous identity such as a Métis citizenship card or Inuit enrolment card). If you have more than one piece, upload each page so we can verify eligibility.\", \"fr\": \"Toujours requis; preuve d\'identité/éligibilité de base\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Status/Treaty Card (or equivalent)\", \"fr\": \"Statut/Carte de traité (ou équivalent)\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 10, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"has_reg_number\", \"value\": \"1\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"status-card\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload the front and back of your status card\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser le recto et le verso de votre carte de statut\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"status_card\", \"showMimeList\": false, \"documentLabel\": \"Status Card\"}, {\"id\": \"uploaded-letters-of-reference\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Upload two (2) letters of reference from Indigenous leadership (Band Council, Nation office, Elder) confirming your community connection. Required only if you cannot provide a Status/Treaty card or registration number.\", \"fr\": \"Téléversez deux (2) lettres de référence provenant de la direction autochtone (Conseil de bande, bureau de la Nation, Aîné) confirmant votre lien communautaire. Obligatoire seulement si vous ne pouvez pas fournir de carte Status/Traitée ou de numéro d’inscription.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Letters of Reference\", \"fr\": \"Lettres de référence\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.doc,.docx,.rtf,.txt,.jpg,.jpeg,.png\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": false, \"maxSizeMb\": 6, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"notEquals\", \"ref\": \"has_reg_number\", \"value\": \"1\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"uploaded-letters-of-reference\", \"validation\": {\"rules\": [{\"id\": \"rule-1\", \"type\": \"predicate\", \"when\": {\"and\": [{\"if\": [{\"var\": \"status-card.length\"}, {\"<\": [{\"var\": \"status-card.length\"}, 1]}, {\"!\": {\"var\": \"status-card.filePath\"}}]}, {\"if\": [{\"var\": \"uploaded-letters-of-reference.length\"}, {\"<\": [{\"var\": \"uploaded-letters-of-reference.length\"}, 1]}, {\"!\": {\"var\": \"uploaded-letters-of-reference.filePath\"}}]}]}, \"block\": true, \"message\": {\"en\": \"Please upload two reference letters\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser deux lettres de référence\"}, \"trigger\": [\"submit\"], \"severity\": \"error\"}], \"required\": false}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"letter_of_reference\", \"showMimeList\": true, \"documentLabel\": \"letter_of_reference\"}, {\"id\": \"acceptance-letter\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"You indicated that you have been accepted into a skills development or training program.  Please upload you letter of acceptance into that program.\", \"fr\": \"Vous avez indiqué que vous avez été accepté dans un programme de développement des compétences ou de formation. Veuillez télécharger votre lettre d\'acceptation dans ce programme.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Letter of Acceptance\", \"fr\": \"Lettre d\'acceptation\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.doc,.docx,.rtf,.txt,.jpg,.jpeg,.png\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": false, \"maxSizeMb\": 3, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"notEquals\", \"ref\": \"target-program\", \"value\": \"self_support\"}, {\"op\": \"notEquals\", \"ref\": \"target-program\", \"value\": \"not_yet\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"acceptance-letter\", \"validation\": {\"rules\": [{\"id\": \"rule_target_program_mandatory\", \"type\": \"predicate\", \"when\": {\"and\": [{\"in\": [{\"var\": \"target-program\"}, [\"skills_development\", \"tws\", \"jcp\", \"group\"]]}, {\"if\": [{\"var\": \"acceptance-letter.length\"}, {\"<\": [{\"var\": \"acceptance-letter.length\"}, 1]}, {\"!\": {\"var\": \"acceptance-letter.filePath\"}}]}]}, \"block\": true, \"message\": {\"en\": \"Please upload something confirming your acceptance\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser un document confirmant votre acceptation\"}, \"trigger\": [\"submit\"], \"severity\": \"error\"}], \"required\": false}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"acceptance_letter\", \"showMimeList\": false, \"documentLabel\": \"Letter of Acceptance\"}, {\"id\": \"applicant-pay-stubs\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"You indicated that you have a salaried income.  Please upload your last three-months\' pay stubs.\", \"fr\": \"Vous avez indiqué que vous avez un revenu salarial. Veuillez télécharger vos trois derniers bulletins de paie.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Pay Stubs (Applicant)\", \"fr\": \"Bulletins de paie (demandeur)\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 6, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \">\", \"ref\": \"income-employment\", \"value\": \"0\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"applicant-pay-stubs\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload the last three months\' of pay stubs\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser vos relevés de paie des trois derniers mois\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"evidence_income\", \"showMimeList\": false, \"documentLabel\": \"Applicant Pay Stub(s)\"}, {\"id\": \"spouse-pay-stubs\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"You indicated that you are married, and that your spouse has an income.  Please upload your spouse\'s last three-months\' pay stubs.\", \"fr\": \"Vous avez indiqué que vous êtes marié et que votre conjoint a un revenu. Veuillez télécharger les trois derniers bulletins de paie de votre conjoint.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Pay Stubs (Spouse)\", \"fr\": \"Bulletins de paie (conjoint)\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 6, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"marital-status\", \"value\": \"married\"}, {\"op\": \">\", \"ref\": \"income-spousal\", \"value\": \"0\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"spouse-pay-stubs\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload the last three month\'s of your spouse\'s pay stubs\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser les relevés de paie des trois derniers mois de votre conjoint(e)\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"evidence_income\", \"showMimeList\": false, \"documentLabel\": \"Spousal Pay Stubs\"}, {\"id\": \"upload-social-assistance\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"You indicated that you receive Social Assistance. Please upload a Social Assistance statement or benefit letter to support the amount of social assistance you reported.\", \"fr\": \"Vous avez indiqué que vous recevez de l\'aide sociale. Veuillez télécharger un relevé d\'aide sociale ou une lettre de prestation pour appuyer le montant d\'aide sociale que vous avez déclaré.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Social Assistance Statement or Benefit Letter\", \"fr\": \"Relevé d\'aide sociale ou lettre de prestation\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 3, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \">\", \"ref\": \"income-social-assist\", \"value\": \"0\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"upload-social-assistance\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload a recent Social Assistance Statement or Benefit Letter\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez télécharger un relevé d\'aide sociale ou une lettre de prestations récents.\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"evidence_income\", \"showMimeList\": true, \"documentLabel\": \"Social Assistance Statement or Benefit Letter\"}, {\"id\": \"upload-child-support\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"You indicated that you receive Child Support. Please upload a child support court order, separation agreement, or payment statement to support the amount you reported.\", \"fr\": \"Vous avez indiqué que vous recevez une pension alimentaire pour enfants. Veuillez télécharger une ordonnance du tribunal relative à la pension alimentaire pour enfants, un accord de séparation ou un relevé de paiement pour appuyer le montant que vous avez déclaré.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Child Support Order or Payment Statement\", \"fr\": \"Ordonnance de pension alimentaire pour enfants ou relevé de paiement\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 3, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \">\", \"ref\": \"income-child-support\", \"value\": \"0\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"upload-child-support\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload a recent Child Support Order or Payment Statement\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez télécharger une ordonnance ou un relevé de paiement de pension alimentaire pour enfants récent.\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"evidence_income\", \"showMimeList\": true, \"documentLabel\": \"Child Support Order or Payment Statement\"}, {\"id\": \"upload-ccb-statement\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"You indicated that you receive the Canada Child Benefit. Please upload a Canada Child Benefit statement or notice to support the amount you reported.\", \"fr\": \"Vous avez indiqué que vous recevez la prestation canadienne pour enfants. Veuillez télécharger un relevé ou un avis de la prestation canadienne pour enfants pour appuyer le montant que vous avez déclaré.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Canada Child Benefit (CCB) Statement\", \"fr\": \"Relevé de la prestation canadienne pour enfants (PCE)\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 3, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \">\", \"ref\": \"income-child-benefit\", \"value\": \"0\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"upload-ccb-statement\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload a recent Canada Child Benefit (CCB) Statement\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser un relevé récent de l\'Allocation canadienne pour enfants (ACE).\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"evidence_income\", \"showMimeList\": true, \"documentLabel\": \"Canada Child Benefit (CCB) Statement\"}, {\"id\": \"upload-jordans\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"You indicated that you receive support through Jordan’s Principle. Please upload a Jordan’s Principle funding approval or confirmation document to support the amount you reported.\", \"fr\": \"Vous avez indiqué que vous recevez du soutien par l\'entremise du principe de Jordan. Veuillez télécharger un document d\'approbation ou de confirmation du financement du principe de Jordan pour appuyer le montant que vous avez déclaré.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Jordan’s Principle Funding Confirmation\", \"fr\": \"Confirmation du financement du principe de Jordan\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 3, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \">\", \"ref\": \"income-jordans\", \"value\": \"0\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"upload-jordans\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload your Jordan’s Principle Funding Confirmation\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez télécharger votre confirmation de financement principal de Jordan.\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"evidence_income\", \"showMimeList\": true, \"documentLabel\": \"Jordan’s Principle Funding Confirmation\"}, {\"id\": \"upload-spousal-alimony\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"You indicated that you receive Spousal Support or Alimony. Please upload a spousal support court order or separation agreement to support the amount you reported.\", \"fr\": \"Vous avez indiqué que vous recevez une pension alimentaire pour conjoint ou une pension alimentaire. Veuillez télécharger une ordonnance du tribunal relative à la pension alimentaire pour conjoint ou un accord de séparation pour appuyer le montant que vous avez déclaré.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Spousal Support Agreement or Court Order\", \"fr\": \"Accord ou ordonnance judiciaire de pension alimentaire pour conjoint\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 3, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \">\", \"ref\": \"income-alimony\", \"value\": \"0\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"upload-spousal-alimony\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload your Spousal Support Agreement or Court Order\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser votre convention de pension alimentaire ou votre ordonnance du tribunal.\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"evidence_income\", \"showMimeList\": true, \"documentLabel\": \"Spousal Support Agreement or Court Order\"}, {\"id\": \"band-denial-letter\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"You did not include any band funding in your declared income.  Please attache any letter denying you band funding in assoication with this application\", \"fr\": \"Vous n\'avez pas inclus de financement de bande dans votre revenu déclaré. Veuillez joindre toute lettre refusant votre financement de bande en association avec cette demande.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Band Funding Denial Letter\", \"fr\": \"Lettre de refus de financement de bande\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.doc,.docx,.rtf,.txt,.jpg,.jpeg,.png\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 3, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"<\", \"ref\": \"income-band-funding\", \"value\": \"0.1\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"band-denial-letter\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload the letter denying you funding\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser la lettre refusant votre demande de financement\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"band_funding_decision\", \"showMimeList\": false, \"documentLabel\": \"Band Denial Letter\"}, {\"id\": \"band-funding-letter\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Youi listed band funding in your declared income.  Please attach the letter approving that funding, if you have it.\", \"fr\": \"Vous avez inscrit un financement de bande dans votre revenu déclaré. Veuillez joindre la lettre approuvant ce financement, si vous l\'avez.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Band Funding Confirmation Letter\", \"fr\": \"Lettre de financement de bande\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.doc,.docx,.rtf,.txt,.jpg,.jpeg,.png\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 3, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \">\", \"ref\": \"income-band-funding\", \"value\": \"0\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"band-funding-letter\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload the letter approving your funding\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser la lettre approuvant votre financement\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": false, \"documentType\": \"band_funding_decision\", \"showMimeList\": false, \"documentLabel\": \"Band Funding Letter\"}, {\"id\": \"medical-documents\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"You indicated that you are requesting support in relation to a disability.  Please provide medical documentation indicating you have a disability and require the requested support. If the any specialist equipment you are requesting costs more than $650 please provide quoted from suppliers of this equipment.\", \"fr\": \"Vous avez indiqué que vous demandez du soutien en lien avec un handicap. Veuillez fournir une documentation médicale indiquant que vous avez un handicap et que vous avez besoin du soutien demandé. Si l’équipement spécialisé demandé coûte plus de 650 $ veuillez fournir un devis des fournisseurs de cet équipement.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Medical Documentation\", \"fr\": \"Documentation médicale\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.doc,.docx,.rtf,.txt,.jpg,.jpeg,.png\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 10, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"exists\", \"ref\": \"disability-support_yes_follow\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"medical-documents\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Pleasu upload supporting evidence\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser des documents justificatifs\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": false, \"documentType\": \"medical_documentation\", \"showMimeList\": false, \"documentLabel\": \"Medical Documentation\"}, {\"id\": \"lease-mortgage-statement\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"You indicated you had monthly rental or mortgage payments.  Please upload evidence in support of this.\", \"fr\": \"Vous avez indiqué que vous avez des paiements mensuels de loyer ou d’hypothèque. Veuillez téléverser une preuve à l’appui.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Rental or Mortgage Evidence\", \"fr\": \"Preuve de location ou hypothèque\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.doc,.docx,.rtf,.txt,.jpg,.jpeg,.png\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 10, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \">\", \"ref\": \"expenses-rent\", \"value\": \"0\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"lease-mortgage-statement\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload your rent agreement or mortgage statement\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser votre bail ou votre relevé hypothécaire\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"evidence_expense\", \"showMimeList\": false, \"documentLabel\": \"Mortgage or Rental \"}, {\"id\": \"upload-utilities\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"To support the amount you listed in householder expenses.\", \"fr\": \"Pour soutenir le montant que vous avez inscrit dans les dépenses du ménage.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"3-months Utility Bills\", \"fr\": \"Factures de services publics des 3 derniers mois\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 15, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \">\", \"ref\": \"expenses-electricity\", \"value\": \"0\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"upload-utilities\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload three months\' of utility bills\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser les factures de services publics des trois derniers mois\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": false, \"documentType\": \"evidence_expense\", \"showMimeList\": false, \"documentLabel\": \"Utility Bill\"}, {\"id\": \"uploaded-resume\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Please attach a recent résumé (CV).\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez joindre un curriculum vitæ (CV) récent.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Résumé\", \"fr\": \"Curriculum vitæ\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.doc,.docx,.rtf,.txt,.jpg,.jpeg,.png\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 5, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"uploaded-resume\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload a current Résumé\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser un curriculum vitæ à jour\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"resume\", \"showMimeList\": false, \"documentLabel\": \"Résumé\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"legal-and-submission\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Legal and Submission\", \"fr\": \"Legal and Submission\"}, \"stepId\": \"legal-and-submission\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Submission\", \"fr\": \"Soumission\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"You are now ready to submit your application. Please read the following legal declaration carfully and indicate that your acceptance with a signature below.   When you hit submit the application will be sent to NWAC and you will recieve a confimation email detailing next steps.   You can sign back into your dashbaord to check status and contact the case-workers.\", \"fr\": \"Vous êtes maintenant prêt à soumettre votre demande. Veuillez lire attentivement la déclaration légale suivante et indiquer votre acceptation par une signature ci-dessous. Lorsque vous appuierez sur soumettre, la demande sera envoyée à l\'ANFNC et vous recevrez un courriel de confirmation détaillant les prochaines étapes. Vous pouvez vous reconnecter à votre tableau de bord pour vérifier le statut et contacter les intervenants.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-hint\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-3\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I, the undersigned, give my expressed and informed consent to the Native Women’s Association of Canada and/or its sub-agreement holders to the Indigenous Skills and Employment Training Program (hereinafter referred to as ISET), to collect personal or sensitive information as it relates to my request for funding under the ISET program funded by Employment and Social Development Canada (ESDC). My consent extends to providing my Social Insurance Number (SIN), to determine my eligibility for interventions such as skills training and wage subsidies as part of the Labour Market Development Agreements (LMDA) program.\", \"fr\": \"Je, le soussigné, donne mon consentement exprimé et éclairé à l’Association des femmes autochtones du Canada et/ou à ses titulaires de sous-accords du Programme de formation et de perfectionnement des compétences autochtones (ci-après dénommé ISET), pour recueillir des renseignements personnels ou sensibles en lien avec ma demande de financement dans le cadre du programme ISET financé par Emploi et Développement social Canada (EDSC). Mon consentement s’étend à la fourniture de mon numéro d’assurance sociale (NAS), afin de déterminer mon admissibilité à des interventions telles que la formation professionnelle et les subventions salariales dans le cadre du programme des ententes de développement du marché du travail (EDMT).\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-4\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I acknowledge that the information is collected and administered in accordance with the Privacy Act (R.S.C. 1985, c P-21), the Department Employment and Social Development Canada Act (S.C. 2005, c.34), and the Access to Information Act (R.S.C., 1985, c.A-1). Information collected is to be used to determine eligibility for the ISET program; to measure results of this Agreement and evaluate its success; evaluate the effectiveness of the Program in achieving its objective; and, to meet its obligations of accountability by reporting on the results of the Program.\", \"fr\": \"Je reconnais que les renseignements sont recueillis et administrés conformément à la Loi sur la protection des renseignements personnels (L.R.C. 1985, ch. P-21), la Loi sur le ministère de l’Emploi et du Développement social Canada (L.C. 2005, ch. 34) et la Loi sur l’accès à l’information (L.R.C., 1985, ch. A-1). Les renseignements recueillis serviront à déterminer l’admissibilité au programme ISET; à mesurer les résultats de la présente entente et à en évaluer le succès; à évaluer l’efficacité du programme dans l’atteinte de ses objectifs; et à remplir ses obligations de reddition de comptes en faisant rapport des résultats du programme.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-5\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"All information referred to above shall be treated as confidential, and the Native Women’s Association of Canada and its sub-agreement holders will take all security measures reasonably necessary for the protection of such information against unauthorized release or disclosure.\", \"fr\": \"Tous les renseignements mentionnés ci-dessus seront traités de manière confidentielle, et l’Association des femmes autochtones du Canada ainsi que ses titulaires de sous-accords prendront toutes les mesures de sécurité raisonnablement nécessaires pour protéger ces renseignements contre toute diffusion ou divulgation non autorisée.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-6\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I understand that my personal information shall not be used or disclosed for purposes other than those for which it was collected, except with the expressed consent of you, as the client, or as required by law. Personal information shall be retained only as long as necessary for the fulfilment of those purposes.\", \"fr\": \"Je comprends que mes renseignements personnels ne seront pas utilisés ou divulgués à d’autres fins que celles pour lesquelles ils ont été recueillis, sauf avec mon consentement exprès, en tant que client, ou si la loi l’exige. Les renseignements personnels ne seront conservés que pour la durée nécessaire à la réalisation de ces fins.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-7\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I understand that the funding opportunity for which I am being considered is intended to increase Indigenous participation in the Canadian labour market and support First Nations, Metis and Inuit peoples’ access to sustainable and meaningful employment; and, provides access to training and employment supports to all Indigenous women in all their gender diversity, in Canada including status and non-status First Nations, Metis and Inuit peoples whether residing on or off-reserve, in urban centres and in rural, remote communities.\", \"fr\": \"Je comprends que l’occasion de financement pour laquelle je suis considéré vise à accroître la participation des Autochtones au marché du travail canadien et à soutenir l’accès des Premières Nations, des Métis et des Inuits à un emploi durable et significatif; et qu’elle offre un accès à la formation et aux soutiens à l’emploi à toutes les femmes autochtones dans toute leur diversité de genre, au Canada, y compris les membres des Premières Nations avec ou sans statut, les Métis et les Inuits, qu’elles résident dans des réserves, des centres urbains ou des collectivités rurales et éloignées.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-8\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I understand that providing false or misleading information and/or omission of information by me about my Indigenous identity may result in an investigation and if the investigation is founded, will be grounds for immediate suspension of any funding and further, revocation of any Funding Agreement between me and the Native Women’s Association of Canada and/or its sub-agreement holders, and will result in a repayment of funds to Employment and Social Development Canada (ESDC), for monies I received to which I was not entitled.\", \"fr\": \"Je comprends que la fourniture de renseignements faux ou trompeurs et/ou l’omission de renseignements par moi concernant mon identité autochtone peut entraîner une enquête et, si l’enquête est fondée, constitueront un motif de suspension immédiate de tout financement et, de plus, de révocation de toute entente de financement entre moi et l’Association des femmes autochtones du Canada et/ou ses titulaires de sous-accords, et entraîneront le remboursement des fonds à Emploi et Développement social Canada (EDSC), pour les montants que j’ai reçus et auxquels je n’avais pas droit.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-9\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I declare that I am an Indigenous person according to the following definition: Indigenous Peoples are people who are First Nations, Inuit or Métis.\", \"fr\": \"Je déclare que je suis une personne autochtone selon la définition suivante : Les peuples autochtones sont les personnes qui sont Premières Nations, Inuits ou Métis.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"legal-submission-sig\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Enter your full legal name then press Sign.\", \"fr\": \"Entrez votre nom légal complet, puis appuyez sur Signer.\"}, \"type\": \"signature-ack\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Type your full name to sign\", \"fr\": \"Tapez votre nom complet pour signer\"}, \"required\": true, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"boxPadding\": \"m\", \"clearLabel\": {\"en\": \"Clear\", \"fr\": \"Effacer\"}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"legal_submission_sig\", \"actionLabel\": {\"en\": \"Sign Now\", \"fr\": \"Signer maintenant\"}, \"placeholder\": {\"en\": \"First Last\", \"fr\": \"Prénom Nom\"}, \"handwritingFont\": \"cursive\", \"statusSignedText\": {\"en\": \"Signed\", \"fr\": \"Signé\"}, \"statusUnsignedText\": {\"en\": \"Not signed\", \"fr\": \"Non signé\"}}], \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}], \"templates\": {\"counts\": {}, \"metaMap\": {}}}}','2026-01-21 13:08:38'),(65,'events_capture','application_submission.application_started','{\"enabled\": true, \"updated_at\": \"2025-11-04T15:26:02.313Z\", \"updated_by\": \"7cad7598-d0d1-708d-0d42-d2abfe7dd933\"}','2025-11-04 10:26:02'),(67,'runtime','intake.ephemeral_ttl_minutes','{\"minutes\": 5}','2025-11-04 11:37:22'),(68,'runtime','intake.session_timeout_warning_seconds','{\"seconds\": 30}','2025-11-04 12:02:57'),(69,'admin','auth.config','{\"admin\": {\"policy\": {\"lockout\": {\"threshold\": 5, \"durationSeconds\": 900}, \"mfaMode\": \"optional\", \"federation\": {\"lastSync\": null, \"providers\": []}, \"pkceRequired\": true, \"passwordPolicy\": {\"minLength\": 12, \"requireLower\": true, \"requireUpper\": true, \"requireNumber\": true, \"requireSymbol\": false}, \"anomalyProtection\": \"standard\", \"maxPasswordResetsPerDay\": 5}, \"tokenTtl\": {\"id\": 3600, \"access\": 3600, \"refresh\": 86400, \"absolute\": 28800, \"frontendIdle\": 300}}, \"public\": {\"policy\": {\"lockout\": {\"threshold\": 5, \"durationSeconds\": 900}, \"mfaMode\": \"optional\", \"federation\": {\"lastSync\": null, \"providers\": []}, \"pkceRequired\": true, \"passwordPolicy\": {\"minLength\": 12, \"requireLower\": true, \"requireUpper\": true, \"requireNumber\": true, \"requireSymbol\": false}, \"anomalyProtection\": \"standard\", \"maxPasswordResetsPerDay\": 5}, \"tokenTtl\": {\"id\": 3600, \"access\": 3600, \"refresh\": 86400, \"absolute\": 28800, \"frontendIdle\": 3600}}}','2025-11-05 11:07:30'),(111,'events_capture','notes.reminder_created','{\"enabled\": true, \"updated_at\": \"2025-11-16T22:28:24.125Z\", \"updated_by\": \"7cad7598-d0d1-708d-0d42-d2abfe7dd933\"}','2025-11-16 17:28:24'),(113,'events_capture','notes.note_added','{\"enabled\": true, \"updated_at\": \"2025-11-16T22:28:26.650Z\", \"updated_by\": \"7cad7598-d0d1-708d-0d42-d2abfe7dd933\"}','2025-11-16 17:28:26'),(115,'admin','backend.jobs','{\"reminderPollMinutes\": 1}','2025-11-17 18:51:24'),(129,'workflow','autoAssignment','{\"rules\": [{\"id\": \"rule-1767705143064\", \"label\": \"QC & ON\", \"assignee\": \"quebec.manager@awentech.ca\", \"priority\": 1, \"assigneeId\": \"296086\", \"conditions\": [{\"id\": \"cond-1767705123014-0.3300433180281672\", \"op\": \"in\", \"field\": \"province\", \"value\": [\"qc\", \"on\"]}]}], \"enabled\": false}','2026-01-06 08:13:44'),(138,'checklist','checklist.compliance.iset','{\"id\": \"iset-compliance-v1\", \"gates\": [{\"id\": \"submit_application\", \"items\": [{\"id\": \"identity-document\", \"label\": \"Identity document\", \"notes\": \"Front and back, but a single image of both is OK.\", \"sources\": [\"application_submission\", \"manual_upload\", \"secure_message_attachment\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"identity_document\"]}, {\"id\": \"indigenous-declaration\", \"label\": \"Indigenous declaration\", \"notes\": \"Auto-generated when the application is submitted.\", \"sources\": [\"application_form\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"indigenous_declaration\"]}, {\"id\": \"letter-of-reference\", \"label\": \"Letter of Reference\", \"notes\": \"Alternative to the status/treaty card. If used, two letters of reference are required.\", \"sources\": [\"application_submission\", \"manual_upload\", \"secure_message_attachment\"], \"required\": false, \"documentTypes\": [\"letter_of_reference\"]}, {\"id\": \"resume\", \"label\": \"Resume\", \"notes\": \"One per client, but must be kept up to date.\", \"sources\": [\"application_submission\", \"manual_upload\", \"secure_message_attachment\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"resume\"]}, {\"id\": \"status-or-treaty-card\", \"label\": \"Status or Treaty Card\", \"notes\": \"Either the status/treaty card (front and back) OR two letters of reference are required.\", \"sources\": [\"application_submission\", \"manual_upload\", \"secure_message_attachment\"], \"required\": false, \"documentTypes\": [\"status_card\"]}, {\"id\": \"band-or-nation-funding-decision-letter\", \"label\": \"Band or Nation funding Decision letter\", \"notes\": \"Either a funding approval or denial letter is required.\", \"sources\": [\"application_submission\", \"manual_upload\", \"secure_message_attachment\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"band_funding_confirmation\", \"band_funding_denial\", \"band_funding_decision\"]}, {\"id\": \"conflict-of-interest-form\", \"label\": \"Conflict of Interest Form\", \"notes\": \"Auto-generated when the application is submitted.\", \"sources\": [\"application_form\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"conflict_of_interest\"]}, {\"id\": \"letter-of-acceptance\", \"label\": \"Letter of Acceptance\", \"notes\": \"Required for applications other than \'Self-employment Support\'.\", \"sources\": [\"application_submission\", \"manual_upload\", \"secure_message_attachment\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"acceptance_letter\"]}, {\"id\": \"medical-documentation\", \"label\": \"Medical documentation\", \"notes\": \"Required only if the client is requesting funding related to disability support.\", \"sources\": [\"application_submission\", \"manual_upload\", \"secure_message_attachment\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"medical_documentation\"]}, {\"id\": \"evidence-of-income\", \"label\": \"Evidence of Income\", \"notes\": \"Pay slips, support statements - anything listed as income.\", \"sources\": [\"application_submission\", \"manual_upload\", \"secure_message_attachment\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"evidence_income\"]}, {\"id\": \"evidence-of-expense\", \"label\": \"Evidence of Expense\", \"notes\": \"Utility bills, rental agreements, mortgage statements - anything listed under household expenses that reasonably has documentary evidence.\", \"sources\": [\"application_submission\", \"manual_upload\", \"secure_message_attachment\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"evidence_expense\"]}], \"label\": \"Gate 1 - Submit Application\", \"statuses\": [\"submitted\", \"in_review\", \"docs_requested\", \"closure_notice\", \"pending_approval\"], \"statusScope\": \"application\"}, {\"id\": \"start_assessment\", \"items\": [{\"id\": \"ei-consent-form\", \"label\": \"EI Consent Form\", \"notes\": 