"Payment made to an employer to offset a portion of wages or employment costs for an approved wage subsidy or placement.\"}, {\"code\": \"Childcare\", \"label\": \"Childcare\", \"notes\": \"Support for eligible childcare costs that enable the participant to take part in an approved intervention.\"}, {\"code\": \"Transportation\", \"label\": \"Transportation\", \"notes\": \"Support for eligible transportation costs required for the participant to attend training, employment, or intervention-related activities.\"}, {\"code\": \"BooksMaterialsDirect\", \"label\": \"Books and materials (direct)\", \"notes\": \"Payment made directly to a vendor or institution for required books, supplies, or learning materials.\"}, {\"code\": \"BooksMaterialsReimbursement\", \"label\": \"Books and materials (reimbursement)\", \"notes\": \"Reimbursement to the participant for required books or learning materials they have purchased.\"}, {\"code\": \"JCPProjectCost\", \"label\": \"JCP project cost\", \"notes\": \"Eligible costs associated with a Job Creation Partnership or similar project-based intervention, typically paid to an employer or project sponsor.\"}, {\"code\": \"SEBSupport\", \"label\": \"SEB support\", \"notes\": \"Financial support provided under a Self-Employment Benefit intervention to assist participants while establishing or operating an approved business activity.\"}, {\"code\": \"OtherEligibleCost\", \"label\": \"Other eligible cost\", \"notes\": \"An eligible cost not otherwise categorized, supported by justification and evidence in accordance with program requirements.\"}], \"interventions\": [{\"code\": \"1\", \"name\": \"Career research & exploration\", \"availablePaymentTypes\": [\"Transportation\", \"OtherEligibleCost\", \"Childcare\"]}, {\"code\": \"2\", \"name\": \"Diagnostic assessment\", \"availablePaymentTypes\": [\"Transportation\", \"OtherEligibleCost\", \"Childcare\"]}, {\"code\": \"3\", \"name\": \"Employment counselling\", \"availablePaymentTypes\": [\"Transportation\", \"Childcare\", \"OtherEligibleCost\"]}, {\"code\": \"4\", \"name\": \"Skills development – essential skills\", \"availablePaymentTypes\": [\"LivingAllowance\", \"TuitionFeesDirect\", \"TuitionFeesReimbursement\", \"BooksMaterialsDirect\", \"BooksMaterialsReimbursement\", \"SpecializedEquipmentAdvance\", \"SpecializedEquipmentReimbursement\", \"Childcare\", \"Transportation\", \"OtherEligibleCost\"]}, {\"code\": \"5\", \"name\": \"Skills development – academic upgrading\", \"availablePaymentTypes\": [\"LivingAllowance\", \"TuitionFeesDirect\", \"TuitionFeesReimbursement\", \"BooksMaterialsDirect\", \"BooksMaterialsReimbursement\", \"SpecializedEquipmentAdvance\", \"SpecializedEquipmentReimbursement\", \"Childcare\", \"Transportation\", \"OtherEligibleCost\"]}, {\"code\": \"6\", \"name\": \"Work experience – job creation partnerships\", \"availablePaymentTypes\": [\"JCPProjectCost\", \"Transportation\", \"Childcare\", \"OtherEligibleCost\"]}, {\"code\": \"7\", \"name\": \"Work experience – wage subsidy\", \"availablePaymentTypes\": [\"WageSubsidyEmployer\", \"Transportation\", \"Childcare\", \"OtherEligibleCost\"]}, {\"code\": \"8\", \"name\": \"Work experience – student employment\", \"availablePaymentTypes\": [\"WageSubsidyEmployer\", \"Transportation\", \"Childcare\", \"OtherEligibleCost\"]}, {\"code\": \"9\", \"name\": \"Occupational skills training – certificate\", \"availablePaymentTypes\": [\"LivingAllowance\", \"TuitionFeesDirect\", \"TuitionFeesReimbursement\", \"BooksMaterialsDirect\", \"BooksMaterialsReimbursement\", \"SpecializedEquipmentAdvance\", \"SpecializedEquipmentReimbursement\", \"Childcare\", \"Transportation\", \"OtherEligibleCost\"]}, {\"code\": \"10\", \"name\": \"Occupational skills training – diploma\", \"availablePaymentTypes\": [\"LivingAllowance\", \"TuitionFeesDirect\", \"TuitionFeesReimbursement\", \"BooksMaterialsDirect\", \"BooksMaterialsReimbursement\", \"SpecializedEquipmentAdvance\", \"SpecializedEquipmentReimbursem