ther than your own.\", \"fr\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"\", \"iconFallbackText\": {\"en\": \"Important\", \"fr\": \"Avertissement\"}}','2025-09-18 13:21:37','2025-09-18 13:21:37'),(1437,112,2,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}, \"name\": \"in_canada\", \"items\": [{\"text\": \"Yes\", \"value\": \"yes\"}, {\"text\": \"No\", \"value\": \"no\", \"conditionalChildId\": \"example-select\"}], \"props\": {\"mode\": \"static\", \"endpoint\": null, \"attributes\": null}, \"classes\": \"govuk-radios\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": \"Do you live in Canada?\", \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [], \"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please tell us if you live in Canada\"}}}','2025-09-18 13:21:37','2025-09-18 13:21:37'),(1438,112,3,2,'{\"id\": \"example-select\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}, \"name\": \"example-select\", \"items\": [{\"text\": \"United States\", \"value\": \"usa\"}, {\"text\": \"Canada\", \"value\": \"canada\"}, {\"text\": \"France\", \"value\": \"france\"}, {\"text\": \"Japan\", \"value\": \"japan\"}, {\"text\": \"Brazil\", \"value\": \"brazil\"}, {\"text\": \"Australia\", \"value\": \"australia\"}, {\"text\": \"Germany\", \"value\": \"germany\"}, {\"text\": \"Italy\", \"value\": \"italy\"}, {\"text\": \"Mexico\", \"value\": \"mexico\"}, {\"text\": \"South Africa\", \"value\": \"south-africa\"}], \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Country or Territory\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--m\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-select\", \"disabled\": false, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [], \"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Select the country or territory you live in\"}}, \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-09-18 13:21:37','2025-09-18 13:21:37'),(1444,113,1,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"You can only choose one\"}}, \"name\": \"example-radio\", \"items\": [{\"text\": \"Yes\", \"value\": \"true\"}, {\"text\": \"No\", \"value\": \"false\", \"conditionalChildId\": \"1442_false_follow\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": \"Have you had a Canadian passport before?\", \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [], \"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please tell us if you\'ve had a passport before\"}}}','2025-09-18 13:28:21','2025-09-18 13:28:21'),(1445,113,2,22,'{\"id\": \"1442_false_follow\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"1442_false_follow\", \"text\": \"This section contains important background information.\", \"label\": {\"text\": \"You may need an interview\"}, \"classes\": \"\", \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": \"You may need an interview\", \"classes\": \"\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}}','2025-09-18 13:28:21','2025-09-18 13:28:21'),(1454,116,1,30,'{\"id\": \"panel\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"panel\", \"classes\": \"\", \"titleText\": \"You live in Canada!\", \"headingLevel\": 1}','2025-09-23 15:47:54','2025-09-23 15:47:54'),(1456,115,1,30,'{\"id\": \"panel\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"panel\", \"classes\": \"\", \"titleText\": \"You don\'t live in Canada!\", \"headingLevel\": 1}','2025-09-23 15:51:26','2025-09-23 15:51:26'),(1458,118,1,31,'{\"id\": \"example-character-count\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Do not include personal information.\"}}, \"name\": \"example-character-count\", \"rows\": 5, \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Describe your request\", \"fr\": \"Champ avec compteur de caractères\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--m\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"\", \"maxwords\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"maxlength\": 200, \"threshold\": 75, \"spellcheck\": true, \"autocomplete\": \"\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-09-28 16:48:29','2025-09-28 16:48:29'),(1459,119,1,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"You can only choose one\"}}, \"name\": \"example-radio\", \"items\": [{\"text\": \"Option 1\", \"value\": \"1\"}, {\"text\": \"Option 2\", \"value\": \"2\"}, {\"text\": \"Option 3\", \"value\": \"3\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": \"Choose an option\", \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}}','2025-09-28 17:16:33','2025-09-28 17:16:33'),(1560,122,1,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"1\", \"fr\": \"Exemple de texte\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-10-07 12:20:32','2025-10-07 12:20:32'),(1561,122,2,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"This is my hint text\", \"fr\": \"Ceci est mon texte d\'indice\"}}, \"mask\": \"\", \"name\": \"example-input\", \"type\": \"text\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"2\", \"fr\": \"Ceci est mon test\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--m\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"autocomplete\": \"\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-10-07 12:20:32','2025-10-07 12:20:32'),(1562,122,3,2,'{\"id\": \"example-select\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Select the applicable option.\"}}, \"name\": \"example-select\", \"items\": [{\"text\": \"-- Select --\", \"value\": \"\"}, {\"text\": \"Option 1\", \"value\": \"opt1\"}, {\"text\": \"Option 2\", \"value\": \"opt2\"}], \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"3\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--m\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-select\", \"disabled\": false, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-10-07 12:20:32','2025-10-07 12:20:32'),(1563,122,4,13,'{\"id\": \"example-date\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"For example, 27 3 2007\", \"fr\": \"Par exemple, 27 3 2007\"}}, \"name\": \"example-date\", \"items\": [{\"name\": \"day\", \"classes\": \"govuk-input--width-2\"}, {\"name\": \"month\", \"classes\": \"govuk-input--width-2\"}, {\"name\": \"year\", \"classes\": \"govuk-input--width-4\"}], \"classes\": \"\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"4\", \"fr\": \"Entrez la date\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"autocompletePreset\": \"\"}','2025-10-07 12:20:32','2025-10-07 12:20:32'),(1580,114,1,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Apply for your Passport\", \"fr\": \"Demandez votre passeport\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}','2025-10-07 13:46:05','2025-10-07 13:46:05'),(1581,114,2,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-2\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"This workflow demonstrates how the intake editor can be used to create custom forms.\", \"fr\": \"Ce flux de travail montre comment l\'éditeur d\'entrée peut être utilisé pour créer des formulaires personnalisés.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-10-07 13:46:05','2025-10-07 13:46:05'),(1582,117,1,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}, \"name\": \"example-radio\", \"items\": [{\"text\": \"Yes\", \"value\": \"yes\"}, {\"text\": \"No\", \"value\": \"no\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": \"Have you had a Canada passport before?\", \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}}','2025-10-07 13:53:53','2025-10-07 13:53:53'),(1584,123,1,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"You can pay extra for an appointment at a passport office if you need it urgently\"}}, \"name\": \"example-radio\", \"items\": [{\"hint\": \"\\tUsually within 3 weeks - it will be delivered securely to your home. £94.50 (or £107.50 for a 54-page frequent traveller passport)\", \"text\": \"Standard\", \"value\": \"1\"}, {\"hint\": \"Delivered by courier to your home 1 week after the appointment.  £178 (or £191 for a 54-page frequent traveller passport)\", \"text\": \"1 week Fast Track\", \"value\": \"2\"}, {\"hint\": \"Collect it 4 hours after your appointment. £222 (or £235 for a 54-page frequent traveller passport) \", \"text\": \"1-day Premium\", \"value\": \"3\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": \"Do you need a passport urgently?\", \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}}','2025-10-07 13:59:20','2025-10-07 13:59:20'),(1587,102,1,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"The Nine Walkers, also called the Fellowship of the Ring, were chosen in Rivendell to counter the Nine Riders of Sauron and to bear the One Ring toward its destruction in Mordor. They were a company of diverse peoples, representing the Free Peoples of Middle-earth: Frodo Baggins the Ring-bearer, Samwise Gamgee his loyal companion, Merry Brandybuck and Pippin Took his cousins, Gandalf the wizard, Aragorn the ranger and heir of Isildur, Legolas the elf, Gimli the dwarf, and Boromir of Gondor. Their task was not to fight armies but to support Frodo’s perilous journey into the heart of enemy territory. The Fellowship embodied unity across races long divided, but as their path grew darker, their bonds were tested, and the company ultimately fractured, setting each member on different but interconnected courses in the War of the Ring.\", \"fr\": \"Les Neuf Compagnons, également appelés la Fraternité de l\'Anneau, ont été choisis à Rivendell pour contrer les Neuf Cavaliers de Sauron et porter l\'Anneau vers sa destruction à Mordor. Ils étaient une compagnie de divers peuples, représentant les Libres Peuples de Terre du Milieu : Frodo Baggins, le porteur de l\'Anneau, Samwise Gamgee son compagnon fidèle, Merry Brandybuck et Peregrin Took ses cousins, Gandalf le magicien, Aragorn le ranger et héritier d\'Isildur, Legolas l\'elfe, Gimli l\'nain, et Boromir de Gondor. Leur tâche n\'était pas de combattre des armées mais de soutenir le voyage périlleux de Frodo vers le cœur du territoire ennemi. La Fraternité incarnait l\'unité across races long divisées, mais comme leur chemin s\'est rendu plus sombre, leurs liens ont été mis à l\'épreuve, et la compagnie a finalement été divisée, faisant chacun membre partir sur des chemins différents mais interconnectés dans la Guerre du Cercle.\"}}, \"name\": \"example-radio\", \"items\": [{\"text\": {\"en\": \"Frodo Baggins\", \"fr\": \"Frodo Baggins\"}, \"value\": \"frodo\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Samwise Gamgee\", \"fr\": \"Samwise Gamgee\"}, \"value\": \"sam\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Meriadoc Brandybuck\", \"fr\": \"Meriadoc Brandybuck\"}, \"value\": \"merry\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Peregrin Took\", \"fr\": \"Peregrin Took\"}, \"value\": \"pippin\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Gandalf\", \"fr\": \"Gandalf\"}, \"value\": \"gandalf\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Aragorn\", \"fr\": \"Aragorn\"}, \"value\": \"aragorn\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Legolas Greenleaf\", \"fr\": \"Legolas Greenleaf\"}, \"value\": \"legolas\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Gimli\", \"fr\": \"Gimli\"}, \"value\": \"gimli\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Boromir\", \"fr\": \"Boromir\"}, \"value\": \"boromir\"}], \"props\": {\"mode\": \"static\", \"endpoint\": null, \"attributes\": null}, \"classes\": \"govuk-radios\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Chose a member of the fellowship\", \"fr\": \"Choisissez un membre de la fraternité\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}}','2025-10-08 13:45:55','2025-10-08 13:45:55'),(1588,102,2,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio-2\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"You can only choose one\", \"fr\": \"Vous ne pouvez en choisir qu’un\"}}, \"name\": \"example-radio-2\", \"items\": [{\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Elven refuge in the Misty Mountains\", \"fr\": \"Refuge elfique dans les Monts Brumeux\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"Rivendell\", \"fr\": \"Fondcombe\"}, \"value\": \"rivendell\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Land of the Dark Lord Sauron\", \"fr\": \"Terre du Seigneur des Ténèbres Sauron\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"Mordor\", \"fr\": \"Mordor\"}, \"value\": \"mordor\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Hobbit homeland in the northwest of Middle-earth\", \"fr\": \"Patrie des Hobbits dans le nord-ouest de la Terre du Milieu\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"The Shire\", \"fr\": \"La Comté\"}, \"value\": \"shire\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Land of the horse-lords\", \"fr\": \"Terre des seigneurs des chevaux\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"Rohan\", \"fr\": \"Rohan\"}, \"value\": \"rohan\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Kingdom of Men near Mordor\", \"fr\": \"Royaume des Hommes près de Mordor\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"Gondor\", \"fr\": \"Gondor\"}, \"value\": \"gondor\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Choose an option\", \"fr\": \"Choisissez une option\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}}','2025-10-08 13:45:55','2025-10-08 13:45:55'),(1605,124,1,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Please select one of the following options to proceed. You will have an opportunity to add family or group members and request additional service options later in the booking process. Hover over the item for a description of the service.\"}}, \"name\": \"example-radio\", \"items\": [{\"hint\": \"Submit new or renewal passport applications\", \"text\": \"Passport Application\", \"value\": \"passport_application\", \"conditionalChildId\": \"example-input\"}, {\"hint\": \"Submit visa applications for various countries\", \"text\": \"Visa Application Submission\", \"value\": \"visa_application_submission\"}, {\"hint\": \"Fingerprint and photograph collection\", \"text\": \"Biometric Collection\", \"value\": \"biometric_collection\"}, {\"hint\": \"Verification of application documents\", \"text\": \"Document Verification\", \"value\": \"document_verification\"}, {\"hint\": \"Book appointments for visa interviews\", \"text\": \"Interview Scheduling\", \"value\": \"interview_scheduling\"}, {\"hint\": \"Check status of submitted applications\", \"text\": \"Application Status Tracking\", \"value\": \"application_status_tracking\"}, {\"hint\": \"Receive passports after processing\", \"text\": \"Passport Delivery\", \"value\": \"passport_delivery\"}, {\"hint\": \"On-site photograph for applications\", \"text\": \"Photo Capture\", \"value\": \"photo_capture\"}, {\"hint\": \"Help with completing application forms\", \"text\": \"Form Filling Assistance\", \"value\": \"form_filling_assistance\"}, {\"hint\": \"Make payments for application fees\", \"text\": \"Payment Processing\", \"value\": \"payment_processing\"}, {\"hint\": \"Guidance about visa and passport procedures\", \"text\": \"Information Counselling\", \"value\": \"information_counselling\"}, {\"hint\": \"Schedule visits to the centre\", \"text\": \"Appointment Booking\", \"value\": \"appointment_booking\"}, {\"hint\": \"Return of original documents after verification\", \"text\": \"Document Return Service\", \"value\": \"document_return_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Issue of emergency travel documents\", \"text\": \"Emergency Passport Service\", \"value\": \"emergency_passport_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Translation of documents if required\", \"text\": \"Translation Services\", \"value\": \"translation_services\"}, {\"hint\": \"Notarizing documents for official use\", \"text\": \"Notarization Services\", \"value\": \"notarization_services\"}, {\"hint\": \"Assistance and queries handling\", \"text\": \"Customer Support\", \"value\": \"customer_support\"}, {\"hint\": \"Medical checks required for some visa types\", \"text\": \"Health Screening\", \"value\": \"health_screening\"}, {\"hint\": \"Collect vaccination records relevant to visa\", \"text\": \"Vaccination Collection\", \"value\": \"vaccination_collection\"}, {\"hint\": \"Courier delivery of documents and passports\", \"text\": \"Courier Service\", \"value\": \"courier_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Assistance with data entry for applications\", \"text\": \"Data Entry Service\", \"value\": \"data_entry_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Confirm applicant identity through documents\", \"text\": \"Identity Verification\", \"value\": \"identity_verification\"}, {\"hint\": \"Legal advice related to visa applications\", \"text\": \"Legal Advisory\", \"value\": \"legal_advisory\"}, {\"hint\": \"Digitizing application documents\", \"text\": \"Document Scanning\", \"value\": \"document_scanning\"}, {\"hint\": \"Collect applicant fingerprints\", \"text\": \"Fingerprint Capture\", \"value\": \"fingerprint_capture\"}, {\"hint\": \"Capture iris biometric data\", \"text\": \"Iris Scan\", \"value\": \"iris_scan\"}, {\"hint\": \"Collect voice biometric data\", \"text\": \"Voice Recognition\", \"value\": \"voice_recognition\"}, {\"hint\": \"Conduct background verification\", \"text\": \"Background Check Service\", \"value\": \"background_check_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Reminders for scheduled appointments\", \"text\": \"Appointment Reminder Service\", \"value\": \"appointment_reminder_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Faster processing of applications\", \"text\": \"Express Service\", \"value\": \"express_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Support for group visa applications\", \"text\": \"Group Application Service\", \"value\": \"group_application_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Specialized support for student visas\", \"text\": \"Student Visa Service\", \"value\": \"student_visa_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Assistance with work permit applications\", \"text\": \"Work Permit Service\", \"value\": \"work_permit_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Advice on immigration options\", \"text\": \"Immigration Consultation\", \"value\": \"immigration_consultation\"}, {\"hint\": \"Certification of documents\", \"text\": \"Document Authentication\", \"value\": \"document_authentication\"}, {\"hint\": \"Information and purchase of travel insurance\", \"text\": \"Travel Insurance Service\", \"value\": \"travel_insurance_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Certified translations for official use\", \"text\": \"Translation Certification\", \"value\": \"translation_certification\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": \"Which service do you require\", \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}}','2025-10-16 14:01:09','2025-10-16 14:01:09'),(1606,124,2,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Enter the requested value.\"}}, \"mask\": \"\", \"name\": \"example-input\", \"type\": \"text\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Please enter your passport number\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--m\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"autocomplete\": \"\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-10-16 14:01:09','2025-10-16 14:01:09'),(1627,78,1,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Eligibility Check\", \"fr\": \"Vérification d\'admissibilité\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}','2025-11-05 09:06:57','2025-11-05 09:06:57'),(1628,78,2,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-2\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Please answer the following questions to determine your eligibility for the ISET program.\", \"fr\": \"Répondez aux questions suivantes pour déterminer votre éligibilité au programme ISET.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body-l\"}','2025-11-05 09:06:57','2025-11-05 09:06:57'),(1629,78,3,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"This program is for Indigenous Peoples: First Nations, Inuit, or Métis.\", \"fr\": \"Ce programme est destiné aux Peuples autochtones : First Nations, Inuit ou Métis.\"}}, \"name\": \"eligibility-indigenous\", \"items\": [{\"text\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios--inline\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Are you a member of a First Nations, Inuit, or Métis group?\", \"fr\": \"Êtes-vous un membre d\'un groupe First Nations, Inuit ou Métis ?\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [{\"id\": \"eligibility-indigenous-required\", \"type\": \"predicate\", \"when\": {\"==\": [{\"var\": \"eligibility-indigenous\"}, \"no\"]}, \"block\": true, \"message\": {\"en\": \"You are not eligible to apply based on this answer.\", \"fr\": \"Vous n’êtes pas admissible à présenter une demande selon cette réponse.\"}, \"trigger\": [\"change\", \"submit\"], \"severity\": \"error\"}], \"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"A response is required\", \"fr\": \"Une réponse est requise\"}}}','2025-11-05 09:06:57','2025-11-05 09:06:57'),(1630,78,4,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio-2\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"ISET is open to Indigenous women in their diversities.\", \"fr\": \"ISET est ouvert aux femmes autochtones dans leurs diversités.\"}}, \"name\": \"eligibility-female\", \"items\": [{\"text\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios--inline\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Do you identify as a woman?\", \"fr\": \"Vous identifiez-vous comme une femme ?\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [{\"id\": \"rule-1756933101438-0dxf\", \"type\": \"predicate\", \"when\": {\"==\": [{\"var\": \"eligibility-female\"}, \"no\"]}, \"block\": true, \"message\": {\"en\": \"You are not eligible to apply based on this answer.\", \"fr\": \"Vous n’êtes pas admissible à présenter une demande selon cette réponse.\"}, \"trigger\": [\"change\", \"submit\"], \"severity\": \"error\"}], \"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"A response is required\", \"fr\": \"Une réponse est requise\"}}}','2025-11-05 09:06:57','2025-11-05 09:06:57'),(1631,78,5,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio-3\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"You must be a Canadian citizen to qualify for ISET funding.\", \"fr\": \"Vous devez être une citoyenne canadienne pour être éligible au financement ISET.\"}}, \"name\": \"eligibility-canadian\", \"items\": [{\"text\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios--inline\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Are you a Canadian citizen?\", \"fr\": \"Êtes-vous une citoyenne canadienne ?\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [{\"id\": \"rule-1757087157281-7u8s\", \"type\": \"predicate\", \"when\": {\"==\": [{\"var\": \"eligibility-canadian\"}, \"no\"]}, \"block\": true, \"message\": {\"en\": \"You are not eligible to apply based on this answer.\", \"fr\": \"Vous n’êtes pas admissible à présenter une demande selon cette réponse.\"}, \"trigger\": [\"change\", \"submit\"], \"severity\": \"error\"}], \"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"A response is required\", \"fr\": \"Une réponse est requise\"}}}','2025-11-05 09:06:57','2025-11-05 09:06:57'),(1632,78,6,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio-5\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"You may qualify if you are not working, working less than you want, or at risk of losing your job.\", \"fr\": \"Vous pourriez être éligible si vous n\'avez pas de travail, si vous travaillez moins qu\'il vous faut ou si vous risquez de perdre votre emploi.\"}}, \"name\": \"eligibility-employment\", \"items\": [{\"text\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios--inline\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Are you unemployed, under-employed, or at risk of unemployment?\", \"fr\": \"Êtes-vous sans emploi, sous-employé(e) ou à risque de chômage ?\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [{\"id\": \"rule-1757087215312-7enu\", \"type\": \"predicate\", \"when\": {\"==\": [{\"var\": \"eligibility-employment\"}, \"no\"]}, \"block\": true, \"message\": {\"en\": \"You are not eligible to apply based on this answer.\", \"fr\": \"Vous n’êtes pas admissible à présenter une demande selon cette réponse.\"}, \"trigger\": [\"change\", \"submit\"], \"severity\": \"error\"}], \"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"A response is required\", \"fr\": \"Une réponse est requise\"}}}','2025-11-05 09:06:57','2025-11-05 09:06:57'),(1633,78,7,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio-6\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"This includes college, university, or other recognized training programs that help you get a job.\", \"fr\": \"Cela comprend les collèges, les universités ou d\'autres programmes de formation reconnus qui vous aident à trouver un emploi.\"}}, \"name\": \"eligibility-training\", \"items\": [{\"text\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios--inline\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Are you pursuing or planning to pursue post-secondary training leading to employment?\", \"fr\": \"Suivez-vous ou planifiez-vous des études postsecondaires conduisant à un emploi ?\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [{\"id\": \"rule-1757087227077-5qno\", \"type\": \"predicate\", \"when\": {\"==\": [{\"var\": \"eligibility-training\"}, \"no\"]}, \"block\": true, \"message\": {\"en\": \"You are not eligible to apply based on this answer.\", \"fr\": \"Vous n’êtes pas admissible à présenter une demande selon cette réponse.\"}, \"trigger\": [\"change\", \"submit\"], \"severity\": \"error\"}], \"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"A response is required\", \"fr\": \"Une réponse est requise\"}}}','2025-11-05 09:06:57','2025-11-05 09:06:57'),(1634,78,8,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio-7\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"ISET funding is for applicants whose education or training costs are not fully paid by other sources (e.g., Band, student loans).\", \"fr\": \"Le financement ISET est destiné aux demandeurs dont les frais d\'éducation ou de formation n\'ont pas tous été payés par d\'autres sources (par exemple, par la bande ou par des prêts étudiants).\"}}, \"name\": \"eligibility-financial\", \"items\": [{\"text\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios--inline\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Do you have a financial need not fully covered by other funding?\", \"fr\": \"Avez-vous une nécessité financière non couverte par d\'autres financements ?\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [{\"id\": \"rule-1757087241712-unb6\", \"type\": \"predicate\", \"when\": {\"==\": [{\"var\": \"eligibility-financial\"}, \"no\"]}, \"block\": true, \"message\": {\"en\": \"You are not eligible to apply based on this answer.\", \"fr\": \"Vous n’êtes pas admissible à présenter une demande selon cette réponse.\"}, \"trigger\": [\"change\", \"submit\"], \"severity\": \"error\"}], \"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"A response is required\", \"fr\": \"Une réponse est requise\"}}}','2025-11-05 09:06:57','2025-11-05 09:06:57'),(1635,78,9,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio-8\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"If you have previously lost ISET funding due to default or other disqualification, you may not be eligible.\", \"fr\": \"Si vous avez déjà perdu le financement ISET à cause de défaut ou d\'autres raisons d\'exclusion, vous pourriez ne pas être éligible.\"}}, \"name\": \"eligibility-disqualified\", \"items\": [{\"text\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios--inline\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Have you ever been disqualified from ISET funding due to default or other reasons?\", \"fr\": \"Avez-vous déjà été exclu(e) du financement ISET à cause de défaut ou d\'autres raisons ?\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [{\"id\": \"rule-1757087254780-h1kc\", \"type\": \"predicate\", \"when\": {\"==\": [{\"var\": \"eligibility-disqualified\"}, \"yes\"]}, \"block\": true, \"message\": {\"en\": \"You are not eligible to apply based on this answer.\", \"fr\": \"Vous n’êtes pas admissible à présenter une demande selon cette réponse.\"}, \"trigger\": [\"change\", \"submit\"], \"severity\": \"error\"}], \"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"A response is required\", \"fr\": \"Une réponse est requise\"}}}','2025-11-05 09:06:57','2025-11-05 09:06:57'),(1656,82,1,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"What is your gender identity?\", \"fr\": \"Quelle est votre identité de genre ?\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-heading-l\", \"validation\": {\"rules\": [], \"required\": true, \"errorMessage\": {\"en\": \"Select an option for what is your gender identity?\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez une option pour what is your gender identity?\"}, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Select an option for what is your gender identity?\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez une option pour what is your gender identity?\"}}}','2025-11-05 09:41:42','2025-11-05 09:41:42'),(1657,82,2,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-2\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"This question helps us ensure that ISET programming is reaching its intended audience. The program is open to Indigenous women in their diversity.\", \"fr\": \"Cette question nous aide à garantir que la programmation ISET atteint son public cible. Le programme est ouvert aux femmes autochtones dans toute leur diversité.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-11-05 09:41:42','2025-11-05 09:41:42'),(1658,82,3,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Select the sex you were assigned at birth as recorded on your birth certificate.\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez le sexe qui vous a été attribué à la naissance tel qu\'inscrit sur votre certificat de naissance.\"}}, \"name\": \"biological_sex\", \"items\": [{\"hint\": \"\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Female\", \"fr\": \"Femme\"}, \"value\": \"female\"}, {\"hint\": \"\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Male\", \"fr\": \"Homme\"}, \"value\": \"male\"}], \"props\": {\"mode\": \"static\", \"endpoint\": null, \"attributes\": null}, \"classes\": \"govuk-radios--inline\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"What is your biological sex?\", \"fr\": \"Quel est votre sexe biologique ?\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"v